=\"img/campus/LHTC1.jpg\"><img src=\"img/campus/LHTC1.jpg\" width=\"90%\" alt=\"LHTC\"/></a></td>\r\n4951:a href=\"http://www.iiitdmj.ac.in/administration/administration.php\">Institute Administration</a></li>\r\n5010:a href=\"https://www.iiitdmj.ac.in/downloads/The Gazette publication of Statutes of IIITDM Jabalpur.pdf\">Statutes</a></li>\r\n5084:a href=\"https://www.iiitdmj.ac.in/downloads/Equal_Opportunity Policy_IIITDM Jabalpur.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Equal opportunity policy for persons with disabilities</a></li>\r\n5164:a href=\"#\">Indian Institute of Information Technology Design & Manufacturing Jabalpur</a></li>\r\n5192:a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/iiitdm_jabalpur/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://www.iiitdmj.ac.in/img/instagram-24.png\" /></a></a> <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/iiitdm-jabalpur/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://www.iiitdmj.ac.in/img/linkedin.png\" /></a></a>\r\n5238:                 © IIITDM JABALPUR 2026-27 - All rights reserved. | <a href=\"https://www.iiitdmj.ac.in/webteam.php\"><strong>Web Team</strong></a> \r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
