merged as <strong>joint winners</strong> at the <strong>SIH 2024 Hardware Edition</strong>, hosted at <strong>NIE Mysuru</strong>. Tasked by ITBP, the team developed an innovativ\n5493:/strong>, showcasing the spirit of innovation and excellence at IIITDM Jabalpur.</h3><small></small></a></div>\r\n5509:strong>Dr. Himansu Sekhar Nanda (IIITDM Jabalpur) and Dr. Harpreet Singh (NIT Jalandhar)</strong>. She won the award for her paper entitled <strong>“Preparation and evaluation of materials properties of solvent casted composite \n5563:/strong>, IIITDM Jabalpur for receiving the <strong>best poster award</strong> in the well- established <strong>24th International conference on \"Surfactants in Solution (SIS)\"</strong> held in <strong>Ind\n6307:\t\t\t\t\tThe IIITDM Jabalpur - Japan collaboration is an aspect of a wider partnership envisaged between Japan and India. The Institute is being developed and nurtured under India - Japan partnership as a uni\n6463:                                       \"IIIT-Jabalpur prepares you for a competitive world by encouraging academic and social growth in students. It encourages students to take challenges head on. Thanks to extremely diligent and har\n6695:                      \"I hope the reader is doing great. I am very happy to be an alumnus of IIITDM Jabalpur. The environment of the college shaped me in all aspects of my future life, including extra-curricular activities, studying, and handling situations. The freedom to create project\n6883:p align=\"justify\">An Institute Innovation Council (IIC) has been established at IITDM Jabalpur as per the norms and directives of Ministry of Human Resource Development (MHRD) Innovation Cell (MIC). Ministry of Human Resource Development, Govt. of India...<br /><a href=\"dow\n6919:p align=\"justify\">DeW is an interdisciplinary design workshop organized by IIITDM Jabalpur in collaboration with the Ministry of Foreign Affairs, Japan since 2010.<br /><br /><a href=\"https://www.iiitdmj.ac.