{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_32","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '4888,4948p' \\\"\"'$TMPDIR/integrated.bin\"; printf '\"'\\\\n-- parttime body --\\\\n'; sed -n '4888,4952p' \\\"\"'$TMPDIR/parttime.bin\"; printf '\"'\\\\n-- visvesvaraya body --\\\\n'; sed -n '4888,4932p' \\\"\"'$TMPDIR/visvesvaraya.bin\"'","aggregated_output":"/opt/homebrew/Cellar/rbenv/1.3.2/libexec/rbenv-init: line 174: cannot create temp file for here document: Operation not permitted\n/opt/homebrew/Cellar/rbenv/1.3.2/libexec/rbenv-init: line 199: cannot create temp file for here document: Operation not permitted\n  \r\n           <div class=\"col-md-9\">\r\n                \t<div class=\"box_style_1\">\r\n                   \t<div class=\"indent_title_in\">\r\n                    <i class=\"pe-7s-news-paper\"></i>\r\n\t\t\t\t<h3 id=\"ug\">Integrated (Master+PhD) Programmes</h3>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p></p>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n            \t<div class=\"wrapper_indent\">\r\n                    <p>Institute offers Integrated (MTech/MDes+PhD)programme in:</p>\r\n                    <ul class=\"list_style_1\">\r\n                        <li>Computer Science &amp; Engineering</li>\r\n                        <li>Electronics &amp; Communication Engineering</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Mechanical Engineering</li>\r\n                        <li>Design</li>\r\n                   </ul>\r\n                </div>\r\n                    <hr class=\"styled_2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"indent_title_in\">\r\n                    <i class=\"pe-7s-display1\"></i>\r\n\t\t\t\t<h3 id=\"pg\">Fee Structure & Other Details</h3>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p></p>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n            \t<div class=\"wrapper_indent\">\r\n                \r\n                <p> <b>Fees for Integrated Master+PhD:</b> <br>\r\n\t\t\t\tEquivalent to M.Tech./MDes for first two years or till formal admission in Ph.D. programme \r\n\t\t\t\t(clearance of comprehensive exam) whichever is earlier. After this period it will be equivalent to Ph.D. programme fees of equivalent \r\n\t\t\t\tbatch (for example a student who has taken admission in 2021 then Ph.D. fees will be applicable for the Ph.D. students admitted in 2021 \r\n\t\t\t\tfrom 2023 onwards).<br><br>\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t   <a href=\"https://www.iiitdmj.ac.in/academics/admission/fee_structure.php\">Details of Fee Structure</a> <br><br>\r\n\t\t\t\t   \r\n\t\t\t\t   <b>Assistantship for Integrated Master+PhD:</b> <br>\r\n\t\t\t\t  Equivalent to M.Tech. for first two years or till formal admission in Ph.D. programme (clearance of comprehensive exam) whichever \r\n\t\t\t\t  is earlier. After this period it will be equivalent to Ph.D. programme assistantship.\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t</p>\r\n                   \r\n                   \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n                    <p align=\"left\"><a href=\"http://www.iiitdmj.ac.in/academics/curriculum.php\"><strong>PhD Curriculum</strong></a></p>\r\n                    <br />\r\n                   \r\n            \t</div>\r\n                \r\n                    </div>\r\n           </div>\r\n           <aside class=\"col-md-3\">\r\n           \r\n            \r\n \r\n            <hr class=\"styled\">\r\n            <div class=\"box_side\">\r\n                <h5>Student Gymkhana</h5> <i class=\"icon-cog-alt\"></i>\r\n                <p>Students’ Gymkhana is constituted to evolve a disciplined self-governance for carrying out various extracurricular in-campus activities and to establish a responsible and accountable student body.</p> \r\n                <p><a href=\"http://www.iiitdmj.ac.in/students/gymkhana/gymkhana.php\" class=\"button small\">More Info</a> </p>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <hr class=\"styled\">\r\n                    \r\n           \r\n\n-- parttime body --\n  \r\n           <div class=\"col-md-9\">\r\n                \t<div class=\"box_style_1\">\r\n                   \t<div class=\"indent_title_in\">\r\n                    <i class=\"pe-7s-news-paper\"></i>\r\n\t\t\t\t<h3 id=\"ug\">Special Part Time MTech/MDes Programmes</h3>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p></p>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n            \t<div class=\"wrapper_indent\">\r\n                    <p>Institute offers Special Part Time MTech Programmes in:</p>\r\n                    <ul class=\"list_style_1\">\r\n                        <li>Computer Science &amp; Engineering</li>\r\n                        <li>Electronics &amp; Communication Engineering</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Mechanical Engineering</li>\r\n                      \r\n                   </ul>\r\n\t\t\t\t   <p>Institute offers Special Part Time MDes Programmes in:</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t    <ul class=\"list_style_1\">\r\n                        <li>Design</li>\r\n                   </ul>\r\n\t\t\t\t   \r\n                </div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wrapper_indent\">\r\n                    <p>Eligibility for Admissions:</p>\r\n                    <ul class=\"list_style_1\">\r\n                        <li>Part time Master’s Programme for Working Professionals:</li>\r\n                        <li>A minimum of 60 percent marks OR a CPI/CGPA of 6.0 (on the scale of 10.00) or equivalent shall be \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t    required in the qualifying examination (B.Tech/B.Des. or equivalent) as the specified minimum for admission in a \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t    master’s programme.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>For such candidates requirement of GATE/CEED is waived.</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>The person must be employed in:\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t    <ul class=\"list_style_1\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  <li>defense establishment, interested applicant should require to submit their applications must be properly forwarded by the Organization or</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  <li>in a company/industry having turnover of Rs. 100 crores or more at executive position and have 05 years or more experience in a company.</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t    </ul>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Other details are given in <a href=\"https://www.iiitdmj.ac.in/downloads/Annexure-III-M.Tech-2021.pdf\">Annexure III</a> </li>\r\n                      \r\n                   </ul>\r\n\t\t\t\t   \r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                    <hr class=\"styled_2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"indent_title_in\">\r\n                       <i class=\"pe-7s-display1\"></i>\r\n\t\t\t\t      <h3 id=\"pg\">Fee Structure & Other Details</h3>\r\n\t\t\t\t    <p></p>\r\n\t\t\t        </div>\r\n            \t<div class=\"wrapper_indent\">\r\n                <p> <b>Fees for Special Part Time MTech/MDes Programmes in:</b> <br>\r\n\t\t\t\tEquivalent to M.Tech./MDes programme \r\n\t\t\t\t(Hostel is not alloted for Part time program so Hostel fee is not required in part time Program).<br><br>\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t   <a href=\"https://www.iiitdmj.ac.in/academics/admission/fee_structure.php\">Details of Fee Structure</a> <br><br>\r\n\t\t\t\t<b>Courses for Special Part Time MTech/MDes Programmes in:</b> <br>   \r\n\t\t\t\t   courses are also equvalance to MTech/MDes program.\r\n\t\t\t\t</p>            \r\n                   \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n                    <p align=\"left\"><a href=\"https://www.iiitdmj.ac.in/academics/admission/Post%20Graduate.php\"><strong>PG Curriculum</strong></a></p>\r\n                    <br />\r\n                   \r\n            \t</div>\r\n                \r\n                    </div>\r\n\n-- visvesvaraya body --\n  \r\n           <div class=\"col-md-11\">\r\n                \t<div class=\"box_style_1\">\r\n                   \t<div class=\"indent_title_in\">\r\n                    <i class=\"pe-7s-news-paper\"></i>\r\n\t\t\t\t<h3 id=\"ug\">Ph.D. Programmes (under Visvesvaraya PhD Scheme)</h3>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p></p>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n            \t<div class=\"wrapper_indent table-responsive\">\r\n                    <p>Institute offers PhD under Visvesvaraya Scheme in IT / ITES or ESDM areas.</p>\r\n                    \r\n                </div>\r\n                    <hr class=\"styled_2\">\r\n                    <div class=\"indent_title_in\">\r\n                    \r\n\t\t\t\t<h3 id=\"pg\">Fee Structure</h3>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p></p>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n            \t<div class=\"wrapper_indent\">\r\n                \r\n                <p> \r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t      <a href=\"https://www.iiitdmj.ac.in/academics/admission/fee_structure.php\">Details of Fee Structure</a> <br>\r\n\t\t\t\t   \r\n\t\t\t\t  \r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t</p>\r\n                   \r\n                   \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n                    <p align=\"left\"><a href=\"http://www.iiitdmj.ac.in/academics/curriculum.php\"><strong>PhD Curriculum</strong></a></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t <p align=\"left\"><h3>For more details about the scheme: <a href=\"https://www.digitalindia.gov.in/initiative/visvesvaraya-phd-scheme/\"><strong>visit here</strong></a></h3></p>\r\n                    \r\n                  <h3>List of beneficiaries</h3><div class\"table-responsive\">\r\n            <table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" class=\"table-condensed\" style=\"font-size:12px;\" width=\"60%\">\r\n                     <tr style=\"font-weight:bold; background-color: #CCCCCC\">\r\n                       <td><p><strong>&nbsp;Sr. No. </strong></p></td>\r\n                       <td><p><strong>Category </strong></p></td>\r\n                       <td><p><strong>Institute Roll No. </strong></p></td>\r\n                       <td><p><strong>Name </strong></p></td>\r\n                       <td><p><strong>Discipline </strong></p></td>\r\n                       <td><p><strong>Present Status </strong></p></td>\r\n                     </tr>\r\n                     <tr>\r\n                       <td><p><strong>1 </strong></p></td>\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
